OL,3,GNEWSABid to offer NHS first refusal on
OL,4,Aformer council HQ collapses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA call to give an over-stretched
OL,7,Fhospital trust first refusal on a
OL,8,Fderelict former council headquarters
OL,9,Fhas collapsed amid a row among
OL,10,Fcouncillors.
OL,12,FCounty Hall, the former home of
OL,13,FWorcestershire County Council, closed
OL,14,Fin 2024 after safety fears and went on
OL,15,Fthe market last month.
OL,17,FThe Reform UK group had called on the
OL,18,Fcouncil to hold talks with health
OL,19,Fchiefs over giving the NHS trust that
OL,20,Fruns the nearby Worcestershire Royal
OL,21,FHospital a preferential deal.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
