OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, ahead of a full council
OL,7,Fmeeting, councillors were told the
OL,8,Ftendering process was already under
OL,9,Fway, with the council saying it had a
OL,10,Fduty to secure the best deal for
OL,11,Ftaxpayers.
